{"product_id":"iqos-terea-golden-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Golden Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Golden Edition: Traditional nutty and woody aroma.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Golden Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. This flavour is called golden for its excellent balance and harmony. The combination of aromatic Indonesian tobacco, nut and wood notes creates a wonderful smoking experience, transporting the user to the atmosphere of a languid evening. This taste will be appreciated by all lovers of the classics.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrefer it if you consider fruit and berry aromas too sweet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764583276599,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764583309367,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-golden-edition-pack.webp?v=1751935248","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-golden-edition","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




